fbtools 1.4.2 - HW systems tooling for LB2
===========================================

bin/fbcheck      command symbol table check (also run by the CM at intake)
share/deployed/  symbol tables as deployed on shipped heads (rev A, rev B)

Installed read-only from the HW systems package repo. Don't patch locally;
changes go through HW systems (I. Marten) so the CM runs the same version.

fbcheck exit codes: 0 pass, 1 table fails, 2 usage / file not found.
